# Repo-level environment variables. Most settings live in the app-specific
# files instead:
# - services/api/.env
# - apps/web/.env
#
# What belongs here is a setting the Node orchestrator reads, which today means
# one: the container engine. `scripts/init.mjs` writes it when you answer
# anything other than podman, and `scripts/lib/engine.mjs` reads it — after the
# environment, which still wins for a single command.
#
# COMPOSE_COMMAND=docker compose
